{"name":"Shay Luuq (Bear)","size":"large","type":"Monstrosity","tag":"","alignment":"chaotic evil","hitDice":"10","armorName":"natural armor","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":4,"otherArmorDesc":"14 (natural armor)","speed":"30","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"60","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":false,"customSpeed":false,"hpText":"114 (12d10 + 48)","speedDesc":"30 ft., fly 60 ft.","strPoints":"19","dexPoints":"11","conPoints":"19","intPoints":"3","wisPoints":"14","chaPoints":"10","blindsight":"0","blind":false,"darkvision":"60","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"5","customCr":"6 (2,300 XP)","customProf":3,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The chimera can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The chimera regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the chimera can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the chimera can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The chimera can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the chimera's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the chimera's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the chimera dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[],"actions":[{"name":"Multiattack","desc":"The [MON] makes two attacks: one with its bite and one with its suckers. It may also use it's wretched breath of it's available."},{"name":"Bite","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK] to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. _Hit:_ [STR 2d6] piercing damage."},{"name":"Suckers","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK] to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. _Hit:_ [STR 3d4] slashing damage."},{"name":"Wretched Breath (Recharge 5-6)","desc":"The [MON] exhales poisonous goo in a 15-foot cone. Each creature in that area must make a DC 15 Dexterity saving throw, taking [4d8] poison damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. Additionally, each creature which fails the save is restrained until it uses an action to break free (DC 15 strength check)."}],"bonusActions":[],"reactions":[],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[],"skills":[],"damagetypes":[],"specialdamage":[],"conditions":[],"languages":[{"name":"Deep Speech","speaks":false}],"understandsBut":"can't speak","shortName":"Bear","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":false,"separationPoint":2,"damage":[]}